# Context hygiene

Keep agent context focused. Prefer links and summaries over bulk attachments.

## Do not @-attach

- `ros2_ws/build/`, `install/`, `log/` — colcon artifacts
- Full rosbags (`.db3`, `.mcap`) — paste last 20–30 relevant log lines max
- Mesh binaries, training datasets, INT8 calibration image sets
- `~/PX4-Autopilot/` wholesale — cite specific files or config keys if needed
- Full vault blueprint or legal docs — link + one-paragraph summary suffices

## Prefer attaching

- `docs/dev_state.md`, `AGENTS.md`
- Specific package source being edited (`ros2_ws/src/dondron_*/`)
- `docs/sil-bridge.md`, `docs/docker.md` when running SIL or container work
- Vault task note for active work (absolute path or paste frontmatter + goal)

## Vault vs code

- Architecture decisions → vault (link, do not duplicate)
- Build/run steps → this repo `docs/`
- Session results → `docs/dev_state.md` + vault task summary
